      en: ["Wukro is situated at an elevation of 2,150 meters.", "Population: approximately 30,000 (2019 estimate).", "Wukro Chirkos church dates back to the 4th century.", "Distance from Mek'ele: 40 km.", "Average annual temperature is 18°C.", "The town was heavily damaged during the Tigray War in 2020."],
